# Cargo build artifacts.
#
# One entry, not two: the merge collapsed the two workspaces into one, so
# there is a single `target/` here rather than one per half. The subtrees'
# own .gitignore files still carry their `/target` lines — harmless, and now
# only meaningful if someone deliberately builds inside a subtree.
/target/
**/*.rs.bk

# Local SQLite databases (created at runtime; never a source artifact).
# From the rusty_remind_me half.
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm

# `dbs init`-generated local scaffolding (manual dbs-cli testing/dev runs).
# From the rusty_dbs half, re-anchored at the merged root: `dbs init` run from
# here writes to the repo root, which dbs/.gitignore's root-anchored `/dbs.toml`
# no longer covers.
/dbs.toml
/dbs.sqlite3
/.env
/.env.example
/dbs/dbs.toml
/dbs/dbs.sqlite3
/dbs/.env
/dbs/.env.example

# Editor / OS
.vscode/
.idea/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Local-only debug scratch (not part of this repo's project)
/.profile-check.ps1
/rc/flatbuffers/

# Claude Code agent worktree bookkeeping (not part of this repo's project)
/.claude/worktrees/
